      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "ab",
      "text": "· Every seeded account starts as studentId@gmail.com, password equal to that id.\n· After saving, a requester opens My tickets. An agent or admin opens the inbox.\n· A person who registered chose their own password and skips this screen.\n· The activity log records the change and does not store either password.",
      "originalText": "· Every seeded account starts as studentId@gmail.com, password equal to that id.\n· After saving, a requester opens My tickets. An agent or admin opens the inbox.\n· A person who registered chose their own password and skips this screen.\n· The activity log records the change and does not store either password.",
