      "index": "b0p",
      "text": "· Only this requester's tickets. The Wi-Fi row opens the ticket.\n· Search is the title. A category filter includes its children. A tag matches that tag.\n· Previous and Next are always here. An empty result is an empty state.\n· This shell has no inbox, categories, or activity log.",
