      "index": "b4R",
      "text": "· Agents and admins see every ticket. A requester has no inbox.\n· Columns are the four statuses. Unassigned tickets stay in Open.\n· A new ticket always starts Open, so there is one New ticket button.\n· Admin uses this same board. Permanent delete is on the ticket.",
      "originalText": "· Agents and admins see every ticket. A requester has no inbox.\n· Columns are the four statuses. Unassigned tickets stay in Open.\n· A new ticket always starts Open, so there is one New ticket button.\n· Admin uses this same board. Permanent delete is on the ticket.",
