      "updated": 1793186457644,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b6p",
      "text": "· Admin adds Delete ticket, then a confirmation. See the next frame.\n· Assigning an Open ticket sets it to In progress unless a status is chosen too.\n· An agent can edit or hide any comment. The requester never sees the internal note.\n· Hardware / Laptop stays on this ticket and is absent from the new-ticket picker.",
      "originalText": "· Admin adds Delete ticket, then a confirmation. See the next frame.\n· Assigning an Open ticket sets it to In progress unless a status is chosen too.\n· An agent can edit or hide any comment. The requester never sees the internal note.\n· Hardware / Laptop stays on this ticket and is absent from the new-ticket picker.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
