      "index": "b7yzV",
      "text": "· Filter by action and by person. A requester cannot open this screen.\n· A failed login has no person. The new value is the email that was tried.\n· Hiding a comment stores its text as the old value. The ticket no longer returns that text.\n· A row never contains a password, a token, or a password hash.",
      "originalText": "· Filter by action and by person. A requester cannot open this screen.\n· A failed login has no person. The new value is the email that was tried.\n· Hiding a comment stores its text as the old value. The ticket no longer returns that text.\n· A row never contains a password, a token, or a password hash.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
